# data/gold/, data/iaa/, data/adjudication/, data/heuristics/ ARE tracked — they're manually
# reviewed ground truth (gold labels, IAA scores, adjudication decisions, sr04 true_class), not
# reproducible from scripts alone (their raw input, the Doccano exports above, is PII-excluded),
# and contain no PII themselves. See notes/fiz/bibner-werk/data-reorg-plan.md.

